        "description": "Normal neurological examination between episodes",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of recurrent cerebellar ataxia episodes with slurred speech, supported by family history or genetic testing",
